 "notes": "SHAFT experiment (Search for Halo Axions with Ferromagnetic Toroids). Headline limit is the blue observed 95% CL exclusion curve in Fig. 4(c), |g_agamma| vs axion-like DM mass over 12 peV-12 neV. Paper g_agamma matches the canonical L=-(g/4) a F Ftilde normalization (CAST reference line in the same figure at ~6.6e-11 GeV^-1 confirms convention). Curve digitized by tracing the lower envelope of the noisy blue trace (narrowband RF-interference spikes going upward were excluded as artifacts); the trace is the strongest limit vs mass. Axis calibration: x log [1.2e-11,1.2e-8] eV (frame edges), y 1e-9 at row516 and 1e-10 at row776. Validated: extracted value at 20 peV = 4.0e-11 GeV^-1, matching the abstract. DM density rho_DM=3.6e-42 GeV^4 ~= 0.45 GeV/cm^3, not rescaled. data_source figure_vision (figures shipped as raster PNG; no ancillary data file).",
